            "sid": "EXO 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Musa na Waisraeli wikam'boria BWANA lumbo ulu:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lumbo lwa Miriamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iji farasi ra Farao, magare, na wajoki farasi wake werengirieghe baharinyi, BWANA oreghiwunjiereghe agho machi gha bahari aighu yawo; ela Waisraeli wereidieghe andu kuomie ghadi na ghadi ya bahari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Miriamu mlodi wa waka, mruna Haruni, ukawada kayamba mkonunyi kwake, na waka wose wikamnugha nanyuma wikikaba kayamba na kuvina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miriamu ukawiboria,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Machi ghiwawie",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Musa ukawighenja Waisraeli imbiri kufuma Bahari ya Shamu hata kireti cha Shuri; wikaghenda charo cha matuku adadu kireti wisewonagha machi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji werevikieghe Mara, ndeweredimieghe kunywa machi gharo, angu gherekoghe ghiwawie; kwa huwo gherewangiloghe Mara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wikamzughunukia Musa wikighamba, “Dinywa kii?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa ukamkemia BWANA, na BWANA ukammbonyera mudi, ukaghukumba machinyi, na machi ghikawuya ghisingie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho BWANA ukawiwikia sharia na malaghiro ghewitima ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ngera mchalusikira lwaka lwa BWANA Mlungu onyu kwa loli, na kubonya agho ghiko gha hachi imbiri kwake, kwa kuiwadia sharia yake na malaghiro ghake, niko aho nisechaamredia makongo agho nerewiredieghe Wamisri; kwa kukaia Ini ne BWANA m'boisi wako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko wikacha Elimu, andu korekoghe na ndoria ra machi ikumi na iwi, na mitende mirongo mfungade; wikabonya kambi aho kaavui na machi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.15.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
